    "image_path": "images/slide_21.png",
    "page_text_ocr_zh": "毛毛虫美育馆\n《明星哪去了》延伸美术活动\n油水分离画\n用白色的油画棒在白纸上画画，退远了看\n还是白纸一张。不过，有了神奇的水彩帮忙，\n白色的图案就会“原形毕露”啦！\n材料准备：\n白色素描纸、白色油画棒、水彩颜料、毛笔、\n调色板、水桶。\n1.用白色油画棒在白纸上自由地画画。（图1）",
    "page_text_en": "Mao Mao Chong Art Gallery\nExtension Art Activity for 'Where Did the Star Go?'\nOil and Water Separation Painting\nUse white oil pastels to draw on white paper. From a distance, it still looks like a blank sheet. But with the magic help of watercolors, the white patterns will 'reveal themselves'!\nMaterials needed:\nWhite sketch paper, white oil pastels, watercolor paints, brush, palette, water bucket.\n1. Use white oil pastels to freely draw on white paper. (Figure 1)",
    "summary_zh": "本页介绍了一个名为“油水分离画”的美术活动，说明了使用白色油画棒在白纸上绘画后，再用水彩覆盖，白色图案会显现的原理，并列出了所需材料及第一步操作步骤。"
  },
